WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:01.459
I’m a spy,

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:03.420
because if I wanna be a writer I’ve got

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.256
to know everything and see everything.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.217
Harriet!

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:12.262
Life is a struggle, Mom. And a good spy never quits! 

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:19.144
My first clue!

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.562
 

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.604
How did you know I was here?

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:24.858
I tracked you with the power of my mind.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.734
*laughing*

